    <div class="legal-document" id="legal-introduction">
      <h1 class="legal-document-title">Legal</h1>
      <p>
        Hi, I'm Bram, the creator of TornManager. This page contains <strong>three privacy policies and three
        terms of service</strong>, because TornManager is three things: the <strong>web platform</strong> at
        tornmanager.com (faction dashboards, war tracking, personal statistics), the <strong>TornManager Chats
        userscript</strong> for Torn.com (chat rooms and in-game tools), and the <strong>TornManager Recruiter
        userscript</strong> for Torn.com (a company recruiting scout). The platform documents come first, then the
        Chats userscript documents, then the Recruiter userscript documents. Use the sidebar to jump to any
        section. If you only use one of the userscripts, its two documents are the ones that apply to you.
      </p>
